 must then choose one recovery action, change either the patch or execution condition, and run one command that can confirm or reject that hypothesis. If the command fails with the same signature, do not repeat the same strategy: inspect the call path, minimize the reproduction, or discover the repository's canonical test command. After two failed retries with the same failure signature, freeze the current diff and execution evidence, compare the failed state with the last known-good state, and switch to exactly one of: call-path inspection, minimal reproduction, canonical test discovery, or clean-environment recreation. Resume patching only after stating what the comparison disproves and what new observation the next command is intended to produce.
 
 You will be provided with:
 1. A trajectory file (.txt) in JSON format containing the agent's step-by-step execution
